units metal
dimension 3
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data structures/nohit_final_cool_0p10ps.data
include potentials/potential_stage69.inc
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
region fixed_region block INF INF INF INF -10.0 5.0 units box
region sink_region block INF INF INF INF 5.0 15.0 units box
region crater_region cylinder z 9.9573898076 24.2578814220 8.0 12.0 100.0 units box
group fixed region fixed_region
group sink region sink_region
group mobile subtract all fixed
group crater region crater_region
group freezone intersect mobile crater
group anchored subtract mobile freezone
group bath subtract sink freezone
fix hold fixed setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
fix integrate all nve
fix anchor anchored spring/self 100.0
fix_modify anchor energy yes
fix bathfix bath langevin 300.0 300.0 0.05 441040 zero yes tally yes
compute Tfree freezone temp
compute Tmobile mobile temp
timestep 0.0001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step time atoms c_Tfree c_Tmobile pe ke etotal f_bathfix
thermo_modify flush yes
dump tr all custom 200 dumps/nohit_5shot_control_0p14ps.dump id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz
dump_modify tr sort id
run 1400
undump tr
write_data structures/nohit_5shot_control_0p14ps.data
write_restart restart/nohit_5shot_control_0p14ps.restart
